  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORTG WOMEN &amp; GIRLS IN ETHIOPIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Women and Girls in Ethiopia&#x2019;s lowlands to realise their rights and live healthy and productive lives free from violence and abuse&#x2019; in Afar &amp; Somali regions. Gender Transformative Approach (GTA), addressing the root causes of harmful gender norms. The overarching objective of this programme is to contribute towards greater voice, protection and economic empowerment of women and girls. It has three outcomes i) Improving Social and econmic empowerment of women and adolecent girls ii) reducinng negative gender norms and iii) strengthning systems and mechanisms at regional level.The programme will directly benefit over 42,000 people of which at least 70% are women and girls. It will also target 3,000  poor women and girls to enhance their economic empowerment through climate smart econmic services.</narrative>
  </description>
